WEBVTT

00:34.730 --> 00:37.776
[narrator] Legend tells
of a legendary warrior...

00:37.907 --> 00:41.476
...whose kung fu skills
were the stuff of legend.

00:41.606 --> 00:47.395
He traveled the land
in search of worthy foes.

00:47.525 --> 00:49.919
[laughter,
indistinct chattering]

00:50.789 --> 00:53.314
[whimpering]

00:57.231 --> 01:02.192
I see you like to chew. Maybe
you should chew on my fist!

01:02.323 --> 01:06.283
The warrior said nothing,
for his mouth was full.

01:06.414 --> 01:09.765
Then he swallowed.
And then he spoke.

01:09.895 --> 01:11.984
Enough talk.
Let's fight!

01:12.115 --> 01:13.725
Shashabooey!

01:16.511 --> 01:18.295
He was so deadly, in fact,

01:18.426 --> 01:20.558
that his enemies would
go blind from overexposure

01:20.689 --> 01:21.951
to pure awesomeness.

01:22.082 --> 01:24.475
- My eyes!
- He's too awesome!

01:24.606 --> 01:27.261
- And attractive.
- How can we repay you?

01:27.391 --> 01:30.307
There is no charge
for awesomeness.

01:30.438 --> 01:33.049
- Or attractiveness.
- [girl giggling]

01:33.180 --> 01:34.920
Kablooey!

01:35.051 --> 01:37.009
[narrator] It mattered not
how many foes he faced.

01:37.140 --> 01:40.404
They were no match
for his bodacity!

01:49.283 --> 01:50.675
Yah!

01:52.721 --> 01:57.769
Never before had a panda
been so feared! And so loved.

01:57.900 --> 02:00.859
Even the most heroic heroes
in all of China,

02:00.990 --> 02:03.297
the Furious Five,

02:03.427 --> 02:06.343
bowed in respect
to this great master.

02:06.474 --> 02:09.433
- We should hang out.
- Agreed.

02:09.564 --> 02:12.044
[all] Yiii!

02:12.175 --> 02:14.569
[narrator] But hanging out
would have to wait.

02:14.699 --> 02:18.747
Because when you're facing
the 10,000 demons
of Demon Mountain,

02:18.877 --> 02:21.967
there's only one thing
that matters and that's...

02:22.098 --> 02:23.708
Po! Get up!

02:23.839 --> 02:25.449
You'll be late for work!

02:25.580 --> 02:27.364
What?

02:27.495 --> 02:29.236
[thumping]

02:30.454 --> 02:31.673
[yawning]

02:33.327 --> 02:35.764
[man]
Po! Get up!

02:44.120 --> 02:45.774
[sighs]

02:47.471 --> 02:49.430
[grunting]

02:50.909 --> 02:53.912
[man] Po. What are
you doing up there?

02:54.043 --> 02:55.610
Uh... nothing.

02:55.740 --> 02:57.568
[grunting]

02:57.699 --> 02:59.135
[yells]

02:59.266 --> 03:02.834
Monkey! Mantis!
Crane! Viper! Tigress!

03:02.965 --> 03:04.140
[roaring]

03:04.271 --> 03:06.360
Uh...

03:09.580 --> 03:12.757
[man] Po! Let's go!
You're late for work.

03:12.888 --> 03:14.368
Coming!

03:17.806 --> 03:21.810
- [grunting]
- [thumping footsteps]

03:24.378 --> 03:28.686
- Sorry, Dad.
- Sorry doesn't
make the noodles.

03:28.817 --> 03:31.080
What were you doing up there?
All that noise.

03:31.211 --> 03:33.561
Oh. Nothing.
I just had a crazy dream.

03:33.691 --> 03:34.953
- About what?
- Huh?

03:35.084 --> 03:36.564
What were you dreaming about?

03:36.694 --> 03:39.001
What was I...? Uh...

03:39.131 --> 03:41.221
I was dreaming about...

03:41.699 --> 03:42.831
...uh...

03:42.961 --> 03:45.660
- ...noodles.
- Noodles?

03:45.790 --> 03:48.053
You were really
dreaming about noodles?

03:48.184 --> 03:50.795
Uh... yeah. What else
would I be dreaming about?

03:50.926 --> 03:53.407
Oh! Careful!
That soup is sharp.

03:53.537 --> 03:59.195
Oh, happy day! My son, finally
having the noodle dream!

03:59.326 --> 04:04.244
You don't know how long I've
been waiting for this moment.

04:04.374 --> 04:07.943
- This is a sign, Po.
- A sign of what?

04:08.073 --> 04:11.033
You are almost ready
to be entrusted

04:11.163 --> 04:15.167
with the secret ingredient
of my Secret Ingredient Soup.

04:15.298 --> 04:17.822
And then you will
fulfill your destiny

04:17.953 --> 04:20.303
and take over
the restaurant!

04:20.434 --> 04:22.044
Just as I took it over
from my father,

04:22.174 --> 04:24.046
who took it over
from his father...

04:24.176 --> 04:26.701
...who won it
from a friend in mahjong.

04:26.831 --> 04:31.619
- Dad, Dad, Dad,
it was just a dream.
- No, it was the dream.

04:31.749 --> 04:35.362
We are noodle folk.
Broth runs through our veins.

04:35.492 --> 04:39.322
But, Dad, didn't you ever
want to do something else?

04:39.453 --> 04:41.324
Something besides noodles?

04:41.455 --> 04:44.284
Actually, when I was
young and crazy,

04:44.414 --> 04:48.462
I thought about running away
and learning how to make tofu.

04:48.592 --> 04:49.680
So why didn't you?

04:49.811 --> 04:51.639
Because it was a stupid dream.

04:51.769 --> 04:54.990
Can you imagine
me making tofu?

04:55.120 --> 04:58.254
[laughing] Tofu.

04:58.385 --> 05:01.692
No! We all have
our place in this world.

05:01.823 --> 05:04.304
Mine is here,
and yours is...

05:04.434 --> 05:05.696
I know, is here.

05:05.827 --> 05:08.873
No, it's at tables
2, 5, 7, and 12

05:09.004 --> 05:10.919
Service with a smile.

05:11.049 --> 05:15.880
[gong sounding]

05:16.011 --> 05:19.406
[flute playing]

05:33.420 --> 05:35.247
[grunting]

05:40.296 --> 05:44.648
Well done, students... if you
were trying to disappoint me.

05:44.779 --> 05:47.869
Tigress, you need more ferocity!
Monkey, greater speed.

05:47.999 --> 05:50.654
Crane, height.
Viper, subtlety. Mantis...

05:50.785 --> 05:52.743
- Master Shifu. Aah!
- What?!

05:52.874 --> 05:55.355
It's Master Oogway.
He wants to see you.

05:59.924 --> 06:04.494
[panting, exhaling slowly]

06:06.235 --> 06:09.717
Master Oogway, you summoned me?
Is something wrong?

06:16.027 --> 06:20.249
Why must something be wrong for
me to want to see my old friend?

06:20.380 --> 06:22.512
So, nothing's wrong?

06:22.643 --> 06:25.385
Well, I didn't say that.

06:29.911 --> 06:32.870
[continues
blowing out candles]

06:43.707 --> 06:48.059
- You were saying?
- I have had a vision.

06:48.190 --> 06:51.106
Tai Lung will return.

06:52.324 --> 06:55.197
[growling]

06:55.327 --> 06:58.418
That is impossible!
He is in prison.

06:58.548 --> 07:01.116
Nothing is impossible.

07:01.246 --> 07:05.207
Zeng! Fly to Chorh-Gom prison
and tell them

07:05.337 --> 07:08.863
to double the guards,
double their weapons,
double everything!

07:08.993 --> 07:10.908
Tai Lung does not
leave that prison!

07:11.039 --> 07:14.085
Yes, Master Shifu!
[squawks]

07:14.216 --> 07:19.482
One often meets his destiny on
the road he takes to avoid it.

07:19.613 --> 07:23.399
We have to do something!
We can't let him march on
the valley, take his revenge!

07:23.530 --> 07:27.011
- He'll...
- Your mind is like
this water, my friend.

07:27.142 --> 07:30.493
When it is agitated,
it becomes difficult to see.

07:30.624 --> 07:34.018
But if you
allow it to settle...

07:34.149 --> 07:36.934
...the answer becomes clear.

07:39.894 --> 07:41.983
[Shifu]
The Dragon Scroll.

07:42.679 --> 07:44.246
It is time.

07:44.376 --> 07:46.291
But who?
Who is worthy

07:46.422 --> 07:49.033
to be trusted with
the secret to limitless power?

07:49.164 --> 07:53.734
To become
the Dragon Warrior?

07:53.864 --> 07:56.954
I don't know.

07:57.085 --> 07:59.870
Excuse me. Pardon me. Sorry.

08:00.001 --> 08:02.525
- Hey, watch it, Po!
- Sorry. Suck it up!

08:02.656 --> 08:03.918
- [babies crying]
- Oh!

08:04.048 --> 08:06.616
Sorry. A thousand pardons.

08:06.747 --> 08:09.750
- [gong sounding]
- What?

08:09.880 --> 08:13.275
Master Oogway's choosing
the Dragon Warrior! Today!

08:13.405 --> 08:15.843
Everyone! Everyone! Go!
Get to the Jade Palace!

08:15.973 --> 08:17.975
One of the Five is gonna
get the Dragon Scroll!

08:18.106 --> 08:21.109
We've been waiting 1,000 years
for this! Just take the bowl!

08:21.239 --> 08:25.287
This is the greatest day
in kung fu history! Just go!

08:25.417 --> 08:28.159
[man]
Po! Where are you going?

08:28.290 --> 08:30.510
To the Jade Palace.

08:30.640 --> 08:32.947
But you're forgetting
your noodle cart.

08:33.077 --> 08:34.949
The whole valley
will be there,

08:35.079 --> 08:37.560
and you'll sell noodles
to all of them.

08:37.691 --> 08:39.257
Selling noodles?

08:41.956 --> 08:43.914
But, Dad, you know,
I was kinda thinking, maybe I...

08:44.045 --> 08:46.438
- Yeah?
- I was kinda
thinking maybe I...

08:46.569 --> 08:50.094
Uh-huh?

08:50.225 --> 08:54.751
...could also sell the bean
buns. They're about to go bad.

08:54.882 --> 08:56.536
That's my boy!

08:56.666 --> 08:58.842
I told you that dream
was a sign.

08:58.973 --> 09:02.063
Yeah. [chuckles]
Glad I had it.

09:02.193 --> 09:04.326
[up-tempo music plays]

09:06.154 --> 09:08.330
- I'm a kung fu warrior!
- Me, too!

09:08.460 --> 09:11.289
- There's spots at the top.
- Let's go.

09:23.911 --> 09:25.913
- [gulps]
- [grunting]

09:26.043 --> 09:27.349
[wheels squeaking]

09:42.277 --> 09:44.192
[grunting, panting]

09:45.541 --> 09:48.326
Come on. Come on!

09:48.457 --> 09:50.241
Almost there.

09:50.372 --> 09:51.460
What?

09:51.591 --> 09:54.463
No! Oh, no!

09:56.552 --> 10:00.382
- Sorry, Po.
- We'll bring you back
a souvenir.

10:04.604 --> 10:08.303
No. I'll bring me back
a souvenir.

10:13.395 --> 10:16.572
It is an historic day.
Isn't it, Master Oogway?

10:16.703 --> 10:21.490
Yes, and one I feared
I would not live to see.

10:21.621 --> 10:23.535
Are your students ready?

10:23.666 --> 10:25.581
Yes, Master Oogway.

10:26.626 --> 10:28.366
Know this, old friend.

10:28.497 --> 10:32.675
Whomever I choose will not only
bring peace to the valley...

10:32.806 --> 10:35.591
...but also to you.

10:39.029 --> 10:44.600
- Let the tournament begin!
- [cheering]

10:46.428 --> 10:48.604
[grunting]

10:52.652 --> 10:54.262
[groaning]

10:54.392 --> 10:56.133
Yeah. [chuckles]

10:56.264 --> 10:59.397
- [door creaking]
- Oh, no, no, wait!

10:59.528 --> 11:03.314
I'm coming! Wait, wait! Yes!

11:06.143 --> 11:08.668
Hey! Open the door!

11:10.365 --> 11:13.542
Let me in!

11:13.673 --> 11:16.066
[Shifu]
Citizens of the Valley of Peace,

11:16.197 --> 11:19.940
it is my great honor
to present to you...Tigress!

11:20.070 --> 11:24.031
Viper! Crane! Monkey! Mantis!

11:24.161 --> 11:26.729
- The Furious Five!
- [chortling]

11:38.436 --> 11:39.655
Yeah, the Furious Five!

11:39.786 --> 11:41.918
[grunting]

11:42.049 --> 11:43.354
[Shifu]
Warriors, prepare!

11:43.485 --> 11:45.617
Wait. No. Oh, peeky-hole.

11:45.748 --> 11:47.663
- [Shifu] Ready for battle!
- Yeah.

11:49.534 --> 11:52.886
The Thousand Tongues of Fire.
[chuckling]

11:53.016 --> 11:55.018
[man]
Whoa. Look at that.

11:55.149 --> 11:56.933
Hey! Get out of the way!

11:57.064 --> 12:00.545
Oh!
[laughing]

12:00.676 --> 12:03.505
[screams, thumping]

12:06.987 --> 12:08.423
[moaning]

12:11.687 --> 12:14.429
[grunts] Ow!

12:18.389 --> 12:19.695
Oh...

12:25.353 --> 12:27.355
Oh! [groaning]

12:27.485 --> 12:29.966
[crowd cheering]

12:30.097 --> 12:33.753
[Shifu] And, finally,
Master Tigress!

12:35.058 --> 12:36.930
And believe me, citizens,

12:37.060 --> 12:39.454
you have not seen anything yet.

12:39.584 --> 12:40.803
I know!

12:40.934 --> 12:42.370
[Shifu] Master Tigress!

12:42.500 --> 12:46.113
Face Iron Ox
and his Blades of Death.

12:49.420 --> 12:51.596
[groans]

12:54.382 --> 12:55.731
[crowd gasping] Oh!

12:58.212 --> 13:02.956
I sense the Dragon Warrior
is among us.

13:07.961 --> 13:10.398
Citizens of the
Valley of Peace,

13:10.528 --> 13:15.795
Master Oogway will now choose
the Dragon Warrior!

13:15.925 --> 13:18.928
Huh?! Oh, no! No, no, wait!

13:20.016 --> 13:21.713
Yeah.

13:29.983 --> 13:31.462
[laughing]

13:38.121 --> 13:41.168
Po! What are you doing?!

13:41.298 --> 13:43.561
What does it look like
I'm doing?! Stop!

13:43.692 --> 13:45.868
I'm going to see
the Dragon Warrior!

13:49.089 --> 13:53.702
But I don't understand. You
finally had the noodle dream!

13:53.833 --> 13:57.227
I lied. I don't dream
about noodles, Dad.

13:59.926 --> 14:03.581
I love kung fu!

14:13.374 --> 14:15.463
[sniffling]

14:15.593 --> 14:20.598
Oh, come on, son.
Let's get back to work.

14:21.686 --> 14:24.602
[sighs deeply] OK.

14:25.255 --> 14:27.692
Ahhh!

14:27.823 --> 14:32.132
Oh! Come back!

14:32.262 --> 14:35.744
[screaming]

14:37.920 --> 14:39.879
[all] Oooh. Ahh.

14:40.009 --> 14:41.924
[screaming]

14:42.055 --> 14:43.665
Uh-oh.

14:54.371 --> 14:58.506
[Po groans]
What's going on?

14:58.636 --> 15:00.900
Where, uh...?

15:03.076 --> 15:04.947
What are you pointing...?

15:06.340 --> 15:07.471
Oh!

15:07.602 --> 15:09.386
OK. Sorry.

15:09.517 --> 15:12.041
I just wanted to see
who the Dragon Warrior was.

15:12.172 --> 15:14.043
How interesting.

15:14.174 --> 15:17.351
Master, are you
pointing at me?

15:17.481 --> 15:21.398
- Him.
- Who?

15:21.529 --> 15:23.705
- You.
- Me?

15:23.835 --> 15:29.493
The universe has brought us
the Dragon Warrior!

15:29.624 --> 15:30.973
- What?
- [both] What?!

15:31.104 --> 15:32.932
- What?!
- What?!

15:34.237 --> 15:37.371
[up-tempo music plays]

15:42.724 --> 15:45.205
Stop, wait! Who told you to...?

15:51.428 --> 15:53.953
[straining]

15:54.083 --> 15:56.303
Master Oogway, wait.

15:56.433 --> 16:00.568
That flabby panda can't possibly
be the answer to our problem.

16:00.698 --> 16:04.354
You were about to point at
Tigress, and that thing
fell in front of her!

16:04.485 --> 16:05.834
That was just
an accident!

16:05.965 --> 16:09.229
There are no accidents.

16:09.359 --> 16:10.752
[grunting]

16:14.103 --> 16:15.583
[straining]

16:23.721 --> 16:26.550
Forgive us, Master.
We have failed you.

16:26.681 --> 16:29.901
No. If the panda
has not quit by morning

16:30.032 --> 16:32.556
then I will have failed you.

16:36.821 --> 16:39.433
[Zeng] Oh! Ahh! Oh! Oooh!

16:50.748 --> 16:53.403
Wait! Wait, wait, wait!
I bring a message...

16:53.534 --> 16:55.927
...from Master Shifu.

17:00.497 --> 17:02.847
What?! "Double the guard?!"

17:02.978 --> 17:04.849
"Extra precautions?!"

17:04.980 --> 17:07.330
"Your prison may not
be adequate?!"

17:07.461 --> 17:09.028
[chuckling nervously]

17:10.507 --> 17:13.815
You doubt
my prison security?!

17:13.945 --> 17:15.773
Absolutely not.

17:15.904 --> 17:18.863
Shifu does.
I'm just the messenger.

17:18.994 --> 17:23.216
I'll give you a message
for your Master Shifu.

17:23.346 --> 17:26.610
Escape from Chorh-Gom prison
is impossible!

17:28.917 --> 17:31.615
- Oooh!
- [laughter]

17:31.746 --> 17:34.749
Impressive, isn't it?

17:34.879 --> 17:37.969
It's very impressive.
It's very impressive.

17:38.100 --> 17:40.624
One way in, one way out.

17:40.755 --> 17:44.846
One thousand guards
and one prisoner.

17:44.976 --> 17:47.501
Yes, except
that prisoner...

17:47.631 --> 17:49.372
...is Tai Lung.

17:53.289 --> 17:55.204
Take us down.

18:00.557 --> 18:05.910
- What are you doing?
- [laughing]

18:13.266 --> 18:14.702
Oh, my.

18:14.832 --> 18:18.009
- [chains clanking]
- [chuckling nervously]

18:19.010 --> 18:22.231
[man] Behold Tai Lung.

18:23.841 --> 18:26.844
I'll, um...
I'm just gonna wait right here.

18:26.975 --> 18:30.935
It's nothing to worry about.
It's perfectly safe.

18:31.066 --> 18:35.375
- Crossbows! At the ready!
- Crossbows?

18:35.505 --> 18:37.986
Hey, tough guy,
did you hear?

18:38.117 --> 18:41.076
Oogway's finally gonna
give someone the Dragon Scroll,

18:41.207 --> 18:42.599
and it's not gonna be you.

18:42.730 --> 18:44.688
What are you doing?
Don't get him mad.

18:44.819 --> 18:46.342
What's he
gonna do about it?

18:46.473 --> 18:49.345
I've got him
completely immobilized.

18:50.999 --> 18:53.480
[laughing] Oh!

18:53.610 --> 18:57.440
Did I step on the
wittle kitty's tail? Aw.

18:57.571 --> 18:59.268
I'm good. I've seen enough.

18:59.399 --> 19:01.531
I'll tell Shifu he's
got nothing to worry about.

19:01.662 --> 19:05.405
- No, he doesn't.
- OK, I'll tell him that.

19:05.535 --> 19:07.450
Can we please go now?

19:22.987 --> 19:26.469
[crowd chanting]
Dragon Warrior! Dragon Warrior!

19:32.040 --> 19:34.129
Wait a second!

19:38.481 --> 19:40.744
I think there's been
a slight mistake.

19:40.875 --> 19:43.312
Everyone seems
to think that I'm, uh...

19:44.748 --> 19:49.492
Ooh! The Sacred Hall
of Warriors! No way!

19:49.623 --> 19:53.888
Look at this place. [gasping]

19:54.018 --> 19:58.284
Master Flying Rhino's armor,
with authentic battle damage!

19:58.414 --> 20:00.547
Whoa!

20:00.677 --> 20:02.505
The Sword of Heroes!

20:02.636 --> 20:05.508
Said to be so sharp you can
cut yourself just by looking.

20:05.639 --> 20:07.075
Ow!

20:07.206 --> 20:10.600
[gasping] The Invisible
Trident of Destiny!

20:12.123 --> 20:15.692
I've only seen paintings
of that painting.

20:15.823 --> 20:18.869
[giddy laughter]

20:20.349 --> 20:23.222
[gasps] No!

20:23.352 --> 20:27.008
Oh, ho, ho, ho, ho!
The legendary Urn
of Whispering Warriors.

20:27.138 --> 20:30.620
Said to contain the souls
of the entire Tenshu Army.

20:33.841 --> 20:35.103
Hello.

20:35.234 --> 20:37.279
[Shifu] Have you
finished sight-seeing?

20:37.410 --> 20:39.455
Sorry, I should have
come to see you first.

20:39.586 --> 20:41.544
- My patience is wearing thin.
- Oh.

20:41.675 --> 20:44.373
Well, I mean, it's not
like you were going anywhere.

20:44.504 --> 20:46.897
- Would you turn around?
- Sure.

20:47.028 --> 20:50.510
Hey. How's it going?
How do you get 5,000...
Master Shifu!

20:50.640 --> 20:52.425
- Oh!
- [moaning emanating from urn]

20:53.252 --> 20:54.862
Someone... broke that.

20:54.992 --> 20:57.473
But I'm gonna fix it.
Do you have some...

20:58.300 --> 20:59.649
...glue?

21:00.694 --> 21:03.392
Ow! I have a splinter.

21:03.523 --> 21:06.526
So you're the legendary
Dragon Warrior, hmm?

21:06.656 --> 21:09.790
- Uh, I guess so.
- Wrong!

21:09.920 --> 21:11.270
You are not the Dragon Warrior.

21:11.400 --> 21:13.446
You will never be the
Dragon Warrior until...

21:13.576 --> 21:16.536
...you have learned the secret
of the Dragon Scroll.

21:16.666 --> 21:18.712
Whoa.

21:18.842 --> 21:21.192
So, how does this work?

21:21.323 --> 21:24.021
Do you have a ladder,
or a trampoline, or...?

21:24.152 --> 21:26.894
[chuckles]
You think it's that easy?

21:27.024 --> 21:29.331
That I'm just gonna
hand you the secret

21:29.462 --> 21:31.420
- to limitless power?
- No, I...

21:31.551 --> 21:34.684
One must first master
the highest level of kung fu.

21:34.815 --> 21:38.601
And that is clearly impossible
if that one is someone like you.

21:38.732 --> 21:41.561
- Someone like me?
- Yes, look at you!

21:41.691 --> 21:44.607
- This fat butt! Flabby arms!
- Ouch!

21:44.738 --> 21:46.957
Those are sensitive
in the flabby parts.

21:47.088 --> 21:49.830
- And this ridiculous belly.
- Hey!

21:49.960 --> 21:53.355
And utter disregard
for personal hygiene.

21:53.486 --> 21:55.618
Now, wait a minute.
That's uncalled for.

21:55.749 --> 21:58.186
Don't stand that close.
I can smell your breath.

21:58.317 --> 22:00.057
Listen,
Oogway said I was...

22:00.188 --> 22:02.886
The Wuxi Finger Hold.
Not the Wuxi Finger Hold!

22:03.017 --> 22:05.541
Oh, you know this hold?

22:05.672 --> 22:08.370
Developed by Master Wuxi
in the Third Dynasty. Yes.

22:08.501 --> 22:11.286
Oh. Then you know what happens
when I flex my pinky.

22:11.417 --> 22:14.681
- [gasping] No, no!
- You know the hardest
part of this?

22:14.811 --> 22:18.772
The hardest part
is cleaning up afterwards.

22:18.902 --> 22:20.861
OK, OK, take it easy.

22:20.991 --> 22:23.342
Now listen closely,
panda.

22:23.472 --> 22:26.562
Oogway may have picked you,
but when I'm through with you,

22:26.693 --> 22:31.785
I promise you, you're going to
wish he hadn't! Are we clear?

22:31.915 --> 22:34.962
Yeah, we're clear.
We're clear. We're so clear.

22:35.092 --> 22:38.922
Good. [chuckles]
I can't wait to get started.

22:39.749 --> 22:42.709
[indistinct shouts]

23:05.993 --> 23:08.691
[grunting]

23:08.822 --> 23:11.302
Ooh!

23:15.916 --> 23:18.135
Ow! Ooh! Ow!

23:18.266 --> 23:20.790
- Let's begin.
- Wait, wait, wait.

23:20.921 --> 23:22.401
What?

23:23.706 --> 23:26.056
- Now?
- Yes, now.

23:26.187 --> 23:28.450
Unless the great
Oogway was wrong,

23:28.581 --> 23:30.757
and you are not
the Dragon Warrior.

23:30.887 --> 23:32.280
Oh, OK, well...

23:32.411 --> 23:36.197
I don't know if I can
do all of those moves.

23:36.327 --> 23:39.156
Well, if we don't try,
we'll never know, will we?

23:39.287 --> 23:43.117
Yeah, it's just, maybe
we can find something
more suited to my level.

23:43.247 --> 23:47.774
- And what level is that?
- Well, I'm not a master, but...

23:47.904 --> 23:50.429
...let's just start at zero.
Level zero.

23:50.559 --> 23:54.694
No. There is no such thing
as level zero.

23:54.824 --> 23:57.348
- Maybe I can start with that.
- That?

23:57.479 --> 23:59.394
We use that
for training children

23:59.525 --> 24:02.745
and propping the door
open when it's hot.

24:02.876 --> 24:04.138
But if you insist...

24:04.268 --> 24:07.054
[Po] Whoa. The Furious Five!

24:07.184 --> 24:09.186
You're so much bigger
than your action figures.

24:09.317 --> 24:13.321
Except for you, Mantis.
You're about the same.

24:14.627 --> 24:17.368
Go ahead, panda.
Show us what you can do.

24:19.327 --> 24:22.373
Um, are they gonna watch,
or should I wait
till they get back to work?

24:22.504 --> 24:23.505
Hit it.

24:23.636 --> 24:25.899
OK, yeah. I mean, I just ate.

24:26.029 --> 24:27.988
Um... So I'm still digesting.

24:28.118 --> 24:31.948
So my kung fu might not
be as good as... later on.

24:32.079 --> 24:36.083
- Just hit it.
- All right.

24:36.213 --> 24:39.521
What you got? You got nothing,
'cause I got it right here.

24:39.652 --> 24:42.481
You picking on my friends?
Get ready to feel the thunder.

24:42.611 --> 24:45.005
I'm coming at you with
crazy feet. What you gonna do?

24:45.135 --> 24:48.095
Come on. I'm a blur.
You've never seen bear style.

24:48.225 --> 24:49.879
You've only seen praying mantis.

24:50.010 --> 24:52.491
Or monkey style.
[screeching]

24:52.621 --> 24:54.928
Or I could come at you
snickety-snake.

24:55.058 --> 24:59.628
- Would you hit it!
- All right. All right.

25:05.373 --> 25:08.681
Why don't you try again?
A little harder.

25:10.117 --> 25:11.553
How's that?

25:14.904 --> 25:17.341
Whoa!

25:17.472 --> 25:20.170
- [all gasp]
- [moaning]

25:22.216 --> 25:23.826
Ow! That hurts.

25:25.393 --> 25:27.351
[screams in slow-motion]

25:30.703 --> 25:32.879
This will be easier
than I thought.

25:33.009 --> 25:35.577
I'm feeling a little nauseous!

25:36.447 --> 25:37.710
Ow! Those are hard!

25:38.928 --> 25:41.365
Oh! [moaning]

25:41.496 --> 25:43.150
My tenders.

25:43.280 --> 25:45.108
[groaning]

25:56.119 --> 25:58.252
Uh-oh. Ahhh!

26:03.953 --> 26:07.217
[groaning]

26:11.395 --> 26:13.049
How did I do?

26:13.180 --> 26:17.053
There is now
a level zero.

26:17.184 --> 26:19.578
- [Mantis] There's no words.
- [Crane] No denying that.

26:19.708 --> 26:21.928
[Viper] What was
Master Oogway thinking?

26:22.058 --> 26:24.278
The poor guy's just gonna
get himself killed.

26:24.408 --> 26:26.889
He is so mighty!

26:27.020 --> 26:31.720
The Dragon Warrior fell out of
the sky on a ball of fire!

26:31.851 --> 26:35.550
When he walks,
the very ground shakes!

26:35.681 --> 26:37.378
One would think
Master Oogway

26:37.508 --> 26:39.946
would choose someone
who actually knew kung fu.

26:40.076 --> 26:42.035
Yeah, or could at least
touch his toes.

26:42.165 --> 26:44.646
- Or even see his toes.
- [laughter]

26:53.089 --> 26:55.091
[straining]

26:55.222 --> 26:57.224
- [thumping]
- Ow!

27:08.714 --> 27:12.979
- OK.
- [floor squeaking]

27:18.811 --> 27:20.639
Great.

27:25.339 --> 27:27.080
[wood breaking]

27:35.349 --> 27:38.482
- Hi. You're up.
- I am now.

27:38.613 --> 27:39.962
I was just... uh...

27:40.093 --> 27:42.051
Some day, huh?

27:42.182 --> 27:47.404
That kung fu stuff is hard work,
right? Are your biceps sore?

27:47.535 --> 27:52.932
I've had a long and rather
disappointing day, so, uh...

27:53.062 --> 27:56.239
Yeah, I should probably
get to sleep now.

27:56.370 --> 27:58.764
- Yeah, yeah, yeah. Of course.
- OK, thanks.

27:58.894 --> 28:01.767
It's just...
Man, I'm such a big fan!

28:01.897 --> 28:04.552
You guys were amazing
at the Battle of Weeping River.

28:04.683 --> 28:07.990
Outnumbered a thousand to one,
but you didn't stop. You just...

28:08.121 --> 28:10.645
- [yelling]
- [wall ripping]

28:10.776 --> 28:13.213
Sorry about that.

28:13.343 --> 28:15.911
Look, you don't belong here.

28:17.521 --> 28:20.394
I know. I know. You're right.

28:20.524 --> 28:24.398
I don't have... I just...
My whole life I dreamed of...

28:24.528 --> 28:28.054
No, I meant you don't belong
here. I mean, in this room.

28:28.184 --> 28:29.664
This is my room.

28:30.839 --> 28:32.885
Property of Crane.

28:33.015 --> 28:34.843
Oh. OK. Right, right.

28:34.974 --> 28:37.367
[clears throat] So, yeah,
you want to get to sleep.

28:37.498 --> 28:39.326
- Yeah.
- I'm keeping you up.

28:39.456 --> 28:41.545
We got big things tomorrow.

28:41.676 --> 28:45.941
All right. You're awesome. Last
thing I'm gonna say. Bye-bye.

28:47.813 --> 28:49.553
Whoa.

28:49.684 --> 28:50.772
What was that?

28:50.903 --> 28:52.208
I didn't say anything.

28:52.339 --> 28:54.515
OK. All right. Good night.

28:54.645 --> 28:55.951
Sleep well.

28:58.562 --> 29:00.651
That seemed
a little bit awkward.

29:02.349 --> 29:04.917
Master Tigress!
I didn't mean to wake you.

29:05.047 --> 29:07.571
- You don't belong here.
- Yeah, of course.

29:07.702 --> 29:09.182
This is your room.

29:09.312 --> 29:12.446
I mean, you don't belong
in the Jade Palace.

29:12.576 --> 29:14.840
You're a disgrace to kung fu,
and if you have

29:14.970 --> 29:18.844
any respect for who we are
and what we do,

29:18.974 --> 29:21.150
you will be gone by morning.

29:26.590 --> 29:28.331
Big fan!

29:35.599 --> 29:39.516
I see you have found the Sacred
Peach Tree of Heavenly Wisdom.

29:39.647 --> 29:41.605
Oooh!

29:41.736 --> 29:43.694
Is that what this is?
I am so sorry.

29:43.825 --> 29:46.219
I thought it was just
a regular peach tree.

29:46.349 --> 29:51.485
I understand. You eat
when you are upset.

29:51.615 --> 29:55.706
Upset? I'm not upset.
What makes you think I'm upset?

29:56.838 --> 29:59.362
So why are you so upset?

30:02.322 --> 30:05.760
[exhales] I probably
sucked more today

30:05.891 --> 30:07.893
than anyone in
the history of kung fu.

30:08.023 --> 30:11.548
In the history of China.
In the history of sucking!

30:11.679 --> 30:14.029
- Probably.
- And the Five!

30:14.160 --> 30:16.553
Man, you should've seen them!
They totally hate me.

30:16.684 --> 30:21.863
- Totally.
- How is Shifu ever going to
turn me into the Dragon Warrior?

30:23.865 --> 30:25.562
I mean, I'm not like the Five.

30:25.693 --> 30:29.392
I've got no claws,
no wings, no venom.

30:29.523 --> 30:32.569
Even Mantis has those...
thingies.

30:34.267 --> 30:37.574
Maybe I should just quit
and go back to making noodles.

30:40.534 --> 30:42.753
Quit, don't quit.

30:42.884 --> 30:46.714
Noodles, don't noodles.

30:46.845 --> 30:51.501
You are too concerned with
what was and what will be.

30:51.632 --> 30:53.416
There's a saying:

30:53.547 --> 30:55.941
Yesterday is history,

30:56.071 --> 30:58.465
tomorrow is a mystery,

30:58.595 --> 31:01.511
but today is a gift.

31:01.642 --> 31:04.775
That is why
it is called the present.

31:21.531 --> 31:23.882
[breathing deeply]

31:26.493 --> 31:28.234
[grunting]

31:34.501 --> 31:36.807
- Oh, no!
- What's happening?!

31:36.938 --> 31:39.723
[man] To your battle stations!
Go! Go! Go!

31:41.029 --> 31:42.726
[snarling]

31:48.341 --> 31:49.820
Fire crossbows!

31:49.951 --> 31:51.474
Fire!

31:53.912 --> 31:55.130
Fire!

32:02.442 --> 32:05.140
Tai Lung is free!
I must warn Shifu.

32:05.271 --> 32:08.143
- You're not going anywhere!
Neither is he!
- Let go of me!

32:08.274 --> 32:09.579
Bring it up!

32:12.147 --> 32:13.932
Wait! Bring it back!

32:27.423 --> 32:28.598
[neck cracking]

32:32.385 --> 32:36.084
- He's coming this way!
- He won't get far. Archers!

32:51.534 --> 32:53.580
[both laughing]

33:03.416 --> 33:07.986
- [indistinct shouting]
- [snarling]

33:36.579 --> 33:38.973
[snarling]

33:39.104 --> 33:40.757
[both growling]

33:40.888 --> 33:42.150
Ahh!

33:44.109 --> 33:48.069
We're dead.
So very, very dead.

33:48.200 --> 33:50.332
Not yet we're not. Now!

34:05.043 --> 34:07.828
- [snarling]
- [all gasp]

34:10.352 --> 34:13.051
[laughing]

34:37.684 --> 34:40.730
- Can we run now?
- Yes.

34:43.211 --> 34:46.040
[all screaming]

34:49.696 --> 34:51.393
[groaning]

34:57.573 --> 35:03.013
- [swallows loudly]
- [breathing deeply]
I'm glad Shifu sent you.

35:05.146 --> 35:07.931
I was beginning to think
I'd been forgotten.

35:08.062 --> 35:09.890
Fly back there
and tell them...

35:10.020 --> 35:14.024
...the real Dragon Warrior
is coming home.

35:16.070 --> 35:19.334
[shuddering, panting]

35:25.819 --> 35:27.516
[all] Good morning, Master!

35:28.822 --> 35:31.520
Panda! Panda!

35:31.651 --> 35:33.261
Wake up!

35:34.567 --> 35:38.092
[chortling] He's quit.

35:39.963 --> 35:42.836
What do we do now, Master,
with the panda gone?

35:42.966 --> 35:44.968
Who will be
the Dragon Warrior?

35:45.099 --> 35:48.102
All we can do is resume our
training and trust that in time,

35:48.233 --> 35:50.974
the true Dragon Warrior
will be revealed.

35:52.237 --> 35:54.630
What are you doing here?!

35:54.761 --> 35:56.545
Hi! Good morning, Master!

35:56.676 --> 35:58.591
I thought I'd
warm up a little.

35:58.721 --> 36:00.767
[straining]

36:00.897 --> 36:01.855
You're stuck.

36:01.985 --> 36:02.856
Stuck? Nah.

36:02.986 --> 36:05.032
What? Stuck?
[scoffing]

36:05.163 --> 36:07.948
Nah. This is one of my...
Yeah, I'm stuck.

36:08.078 --> 36:10.298
- Help him.
- Oh, dear.

36:11.386 --> 36:13.910
Maybe on three.
One, two...

36:14.781 --> 36:16.174
...three.

36:17.697 --> 36:19.438
- Thank you.
- Don't mention it.

36:19.568 --> 36:22.223
- No, really, I appreciate...
- Ever.

36:22.354 --> 36:26.575
You actually thought
you could learn to do
a full split in one night?

36:26.706 --> 36:30.231
It takes years to develop
one's flexibility!

36:30.362 --> 36:33.843
And years longer
to apply it in combat!

36:34.322 --> 36:35.497
Ooh...

36:43.418 --> 36:46.465
Put that down! The only
souvenirs we collect here

36:46.595 --> 36:49.381
are bloody knuckles
and broken bones.

36:49.511 --> 36:52.514
Yeah! [chuckling]
Excellent.

36:52.645 --> 36:54.777
Let's get started.

36:56.736 --> 36:58.694
- Are you ready?
- I was born re...

36:58.825 --> 37:00.827
Ow! [grunting]

37:00.957 --> 37:03.743
I'm sorry, brother. I thought
you said you were ready.

37:03.873 --> 37:07.268
That was awesome!
Let's go again!

37:12.186 --> 37:13.796
Ow! Oh!

37:14.275 --> 37:16.146
Ahh!

37:16.277 --> 37:18.236
Ohhh.

37:26.069 --> 37:29.203
[grunting] Ah... Ow!

37:29.334 --> 37:31.858
[chuckling]

37:33.555 --> 37:36.384
I've been taking it easy on you,
panda. But no more.

37:36.515 --> 37:38.734
Your next opponent will be me.

37:38.865 --> 37:40.823
All right! Yeah, let's go!

37:43.173 --> 37:45.263
Step forth.

37:45.393 --> 37:48.701
The true path to victory is to
find your opponent's weakness...

37:48.831 --> 37:50.616
...and make him
suffer for it.

37:50.746 --> 37:52.095
Oh, yeah!

37:52.226 --> 37:53.532
To take his strength

37:53.662 --> 37:55.621
and use it against him...

37:55.751 --> 37:58.101
...until he finally falls...

37:58.232 --> 37:59.277
...or quits.

37:59.407 --> 38:01.235
But a real warrior
never quits.

38:01.366 --> 38:04.325
Don't worry, Master.
I will never quit!

38:04.456 --> 38:07.110
[screaming]

38:10.331 --> 38:12.594
Ow! Ow!

38:14.770 --> 38:18.078
If he's smart, he won't
come back up those steps.

38:18.208 --> 38:19.471
But he will.

38:19.601 --> 38:21.908
He's not going to quit,
is he?

38:22.038 --> 38:24.650
He's not going to quit bouncing,
I'll tell you that.

38:24.780 --> 38:26.260
[laughing]

38:26.391 --> 38:29.132
[Po] Oh! Ooh! Ah! Ooh!

38:32.832 --> 38:34.921
[exclaiming]

38:36.575 --> 38:39.491
I thought you said acupuncture
would make me feel better.

38:39.621 --> 38:41.667
Trust me, it will.
It's just not easy

38:41.797 --> 38:44.365
finding the right nerve points
under all this...

38:44.496 --> 38:47.107
- Fat?
- Fur. I was going to say fur.

38:47.237 --> 38:49.501
- Sure you were.
- Who am I to judge a warrior

38:49.631 --> 38:52.547
based on his size?
I mean, look at me.

38:53.592 --> 38:55.681
- I'm over here.
- Ah-ha!

38:55.811 --> 38:58.031
Maybe you should
look at this again.

38:58.161 --> 39:01.164
Oh, OK.

39:01.295 --> 39:03.297
[Po] Ow! [laughing]

39:03.428 --> 39:06.300
Stop it. Stop!

39:06.431 --> 39:09.695
I know Master Shifu is trying
to inspire me and all...

39:09.825 --> 39:11.436
...but if I
didn't know better,

39:11.566 --> 39:13.351
I'd say he was trying
to get rid of me.

39:13.481 --> 39:16.354
[laughing]

39:18.486 --> 39:21.184
I know he can seem
kind of heartless...

39:21.315 --> 39:23.448
...but he wasn't
always like that.

39:23.578 --> 39:26.102
[Viper] According to legend,
there was once a time

39:26.233 --> 39:29.410
when Master Shifu
actually used to smile.

39:29.541 --> 39:31.412
- [Po] No!
- [Mantis] Yes.

39:31.543 --> 39:32.761
[Viper]
But that was before.

39:32.892 --> 39:34.372
Before what?

39:34.502 --> 39:36.286
Before Tai Lung.

39:36.417 --> 39:38.767
We're not really supposed
to talk about him.

39:38.898 --> 39:41.857
Well, if he's going to
stay here, he should know.

39:41.988 --> 39:43.990
Guys, guys,
I know about Tai Lung.

39:44.120 --> 39:46.906
He was a student.
The first ever to master

39:47.036 --> 39:49.474
the thousand scrolls of kung fu.

39:49.604 --> 39:53.739
And then he turned bad,
and now he's in jail.

39:53.869 --> 39:56.176
He wasn't just a student.

40:00.310 --> 40:03.357
Shifu found him as a cub...

40:04.706 --> 40:07.492
...and he raised him
as his son.

40:10.103 --> 40:13.367
And when the boy showed
talent in kung fu...

40:14.237 --> 40:16.501
...Shifu trained him.

40:16.631 --> 40:21.593
He believed in him. He told him
he was destined for greatness.

40:21.723 --> 40:24.378
It was never enough
for Tai Lung.

40:26.902 --> 40:28.469
He wanted the Dragon Scroll.

40:28.600 --> 40:32.908
But Oogway saw darkness
in his heart and refused.

40:33.039 --> 40:37.086
Outraged, Tai Lung
laid waste to the valley.

40:39.306 --> 40:41.134
He tried to take
the scroll by force.

40:41.264 --> 40:46.269
And Shifu had to destroy
what he had created.

40:48.010 --> 40:49.795
But how could he?

40:57.063 --> 41:02.808
[panting]

41:02.938 --> 41:08.117
Shifu loved Tai Lung like he
had never loved anyone before.

41:16.125 --> 41:17.605
Or since.

41:26.048 --> 41:28.834
And now he has a chance
to make things right.

41:28.964 --> 41:31.140
To train the
true Dragon Warrior.

41:31.271 --> 41:34.230
And he's stuck with you.

41:34.361 --> 41:38.757
A big fat panda
who treats it like a joke.

41:38.887 --> 41:41.150
- Oh, that is it!
- Wait! My fault!

41:41.281 --> 41:43.457
I accidentally tweaked
his facial nerve.

41:45.590 --> 41:48.331
And may have also
stopped his heart.

41:51.683 --> 41:53.554
Inner peace.

41:54.642 --> 41:56.818
Inner peace.

41:59.691 --> 42:01.519
Inner...

42:02.955 --> 42:05.087
Inner peace.

42:07.829 --> 42:12.530
Would whoever is making
that flapping sound quiet down?!

42:15.620 --> 42:16.708
Inner...

42:16.838 --> 42:19.711
- [squawks]
- Hmm...

42:21.408 --> 42:23.453
Oh, Zeng.

42:23.584 --> 42:25.194
Excellent.

42:25.325 --> 42:27.370
I could use some
good news right now.

42:30.417 --> 42:31.984
Uhhh...

42:34.813 --> 42:36.902
- Master! Master!
- Hmm?

42:37.032 --> 42:41.210
I have... It's...
It's very bad news.

42:41.341 --> 42:43.691
Ahh, Shifu.

42:43.822 --> 42:47.129
There is just news.
There is no good or bad.

42:47.260 --> 42:50.742
Master, your vision.
Your vision was right.

42:50.872 --> 42:54.572
Tai Lung has broken out of
prison. He's on his way.

42:55.790 --> 42:58.619
That is bad news...

42:58.750 --> 43:02.449
...if you do not believe that
the Dragon Warrior can stop him.

43:02.580 --> 43:07.193
The panda? Master, that panda
is not the Dragon Warrior.

43:07.323 --> 43:10.718
He wasn't meant to be here!
It was an accident.

43:10.849 --> 43:12.981
There are no accidents.

43:13.112 --> 43:17.203
[sighing heavily] Yes, I know.
You've said that already.

43:17.333 --> 43:21.642
- Twice.
- Well, that was
no accident, either.

43:21.773 --> 43:22.904
Thrice.

43:23.035 --> 43:24.602
My old friend,

43:24.732 --> 43:29.258
the panda will never fulfill
his destiny, nor you yours,

43:29.389 --> 43:32.784
until you let go
of the illusion of control.

43:32.914 --> 43:34.350
Illusion?

43:34.481 --> 43:37.397
Yes. Look at
this tree, Shifu.

43:37.527 --> 43:40.443
I cannot make it blossom
when it suits me,

43:40.574 --> 43:43.751
nor make it bear fruit
before its time.

43:43.882 --> 43:47.233
But there are things
we can control.

43:47.363 --> 43:49.496
I can control
when the fruit will fall.

43:49.627 --> 43:51.541
- [grunts]
- [chuckles]

43:51.672 --> 43:53.587
And I can control...

43:54.588 --> 43:56.938
...where to plant the seed.

43:57.069 --> 43:59.245
That is no illusion, Master.

44:00.725 --> 44:02.727
Ah, yes.

44:02.857 --> 44:05.207
But no matter what you do

44:05.338 --> 44:08.167
that seed will grow
to be a peach tree.

44:08.297 --> 44:10.735
You may wish for
an apple or an orange,

44:10.865 --> 44:12.954
but you will get a peach.

44:13.085 --> 44:16.784
But a peach cannot
defeat Tai Lung!

44:16.915 --> 44:19.569
Maybe it can.

44:19.700 --> 44:22.398
If you are willing to guide it.

44:22.529 --> 44:24.357
To nurture it.

44:24.487 --> 44:25.750
To believe in it.

44:25.880 --> 44:28.274
But how? How?

44:28.404 --> 44:30.450
I need your help, Master.

44:30.580 --> 44:34.759
No, you just need to believe.

44:34.889 --> 44:37.631
Promise me, Shifu.

44:37.762 --> 44:40.373
Promise me you will believe.

44:40.503 --> 44:44.290
I will try.

44:44.943 --> 44:46.640
Good.

44:48.555 --> 44:50.818
My time has come.

44:52.907 --> 44:57.216
You must continue
your journey without me.

44:57.346 --> 45:00.001
What are you...? Wait!

45:01.176 --> 45:03.135
Master!

45:03.265 --> 45:05.006
You can't leave me!

45:08.575 --> 45:11.447
You must believe.

45:12.231 --> 45:13.972
Master!

45:44.306 --> 45:46.918
[Po] Yeah, so I'm like,
"Fine, you may be a wolf,

45:47.048 --> 45:50.138
you may be the scariest bandit
in Haijin Province...

45:50.269 --> 45:52.010
...but you're a lousy tipper."

45:52.140 --> 45:55.709
Really? So how did you
get out of there alive?

45:55.840 --> 45:58.451
I mean, I didn't
actually say that...

45:58.581 --> 46:00.018
...but I thought it...

46:00.148 --> 46:01.759
...in my mind.

46:01.889 --> 46:03.804
If he could read my mind,

46:03.935 --> 46:05.284
he'd have been, like, "What?"

46:05.414 --> 46:09.505
Order up!
Hope you like it.

46:09.636 --> 46:12.813
- This is really good!
- No, come on.

46:12.944 --> 46:14.684
Try my dad's
Secret Ingredient Soup.

46:14.815 --> 46:17.078
He actually knows
the secret ingredient.

46:17.209 --> 46:19.733
What do you talking about?
This is amazing!

46:19.864 --> 46:21.256
[Crane] Wow, you're a good cook.

46:21.387 --> 46:22.867
[Mantis] I wish
my mouth was bigger.

46:22.997 --> 46:24.738
Tigress,
you've got to try this.

46:24.869 --> 46:28.220
It is said that the Dragon
Warrior can survive for months

46:28.350 --> 46:33.486
on nothing but the dew of
a single ginkgo leaf and
the energy of the universe.

46:33.616 --> 46:38.578
I guess my body doesn't know
it's the Dragon Warrior yet.

46:38.708 --> 46:43.801
I'm gonna need a lot more
than dew and universe juice.

46:45.541 --> 46:47.892
[all laughing]

46:48.022 --> 46:50.764
- What?
- Oh, nothing... Master Shifu.

46:50.895 --> 46:52.984
[all laughing]

46:53.114 --> 46:55.551
[imitating Shifu] You'll
never be the Dragon Warrior

46:55.682 --> 46:58.903
- unless you lose 500 pounds
and brush your teeth!
- [laughter]

46:59.033 --> 47:00.513
What is that noise
you're making?

47:00.643 --> 47:02.471
Laughter?
I never heard of it!

47:02.602 --> 47:05.561
Work hard, panda,
and maybe someday...

47:05.692 --> 47:07.650
...you will have ears like mine.

47:09.043 --> 47:11.219
- That's good.
- [laughter stops]

47:11.350 --> 47:14.483
Ears. It's not working for you?
I thought they were pretty good.

47:14.614 --> 47:17.791
- It's Shifu!
- Of course.
What do you think I'm doing?

47:18.836 --> 47:22.100
Oooh!
Master Shifu!

47:22.230 --> 47:25.277
[laughter]

47:25.407 --> 47:27.018
[Shifu] You think this is funny?

47:27.148 --> 47:29.890
Tai Lung has escaped,
and you're acting like children!

47:30.021 --> 47:32.458
- What?
- He is coming
for the Dragon Scroll,

47:32.588 --> 47:34.982
and you are the only one
who can stop him.

47:37.289 --> 47:38.986
[laughing]
And here I am,

47:39.117 --> 47:40.988
saying you got
no sense of humor.

47:41.119 --> 47:43.295
I'm gonna...
stop Tai Lung.

47:43.425 --> 47:46.167
What? You're serious?
And I have to...?

47:46.298 --> 47:50.302
[stammering] Master Oogway
will stop him, he did before.

47:50.432 --> 47:53.261
- He'll do it again.
- Oogway cannot!

47:53.392 --> 47:56.134
- Not anymore.
- [all gasping]

47:56.264 --> 47:58.701
Our only hope
is the Dragon Warrior.

47:58.832 --> 48:00.486
- The panda?
- Yes, the panda!

48:00.616 --> 48:02.488
Master, let us
stop Tai Lung.

48:02.618 --> 48:04.229
This is what
you've trained us for.

48:04.359 --> 48:06.187
No! It is not your destiny

48:06.318 --> 48:07.841
to defeat Tai Lung.

48:07.972 --> 48:09.582
It is his!

48:09.712 --> 48:10.757
Where'd he go?

48:10.888 --> 48:14.717
[screaming]

48:18.243 --> 48:21.463
You cannot leave!
A real warrior never quits.

48:21.594 --> 48:23.291
Watch me.

48:25.772 --> 48:28.209
Come on. How am I
supposed to beat Tai Lung?

48:28.340 --> 48:30.516
I can't even
beat you to the stairs.

48:30.646 --> 48:34.563
- You will beat him because
you are the Dragon Warrior.
- Ow!

48:34.694 --> 48:37.827
You don't believe that. Oh!
You never believed that.

48:37.958 --> 48:40.874
From the first moment
I got here, you've been
trying to get rid of me.

48:41.005 --> 48:43.268
Yes! I was.

48:43.398 --> 48:45.705
But now I ask you
to trust in your master

48:45.835 --> 48:48.577
as I have come
to trust in mine.

48:48.708 --> 48:53.191
[grunts] You're not my master.
And I'm not the Dragon Warrior.

48:53.321 --> 48:57.760
Then why didn't you quit?!
You knew I was trying to get
rid of you, yet you stayed.

48:57.891 --> 48:59.849
Yeah, I stayed.

48:59.980 --> 49:03.723
I stayed because every time
you threw a brick at my head

49:03.853 --> 49:08.119
or said I smelled, it hurt,
but it could never hurt more

49:08.249 --> 49:12.384
than it did every day
of my life just being me.

49:12.514 --> 49:16.997
I stayed because I thought,
if anyone could change me...

49:17.128 --> 49:20.044
...could make me... not me...

49:20.174 --> 49:21.784
...it was you.

49:21.915 --> 49:24.787
The greatest kung fu teacher
in all of China!

49:24.918 --> 49:26.528
But I can change you!

49:26.659 --> 49:30.097
I can turn you into
the Dragon Warrior! And I will!

49:30.228 --> 49:34.145
Come on. Tai Lung is
on his way here right now.

49:34.275 --> 49:37.583
Even if it takes him
a hundred years to get here,
how are you...

49:37.713 --> 49:42.109
...gonna change this
into the Dragon Warrior, huh?

49:44.285 --> 49:45.417
How?

49:46.896 --> 49:48.072
How?

49:50.988 --> 49:53.294
- How?!
- I don't know!

50:01.172 --> 50:02.956
I don't know.

50:09.484 --> 50:11.747
That's what I thought.

50:50.264 --> 50:52.614
This is what you trained me for.

50:59.621 --> 51:00.709
[Viper] Tigress!

51:04.757 --> 51:06.715
Don't try and stop me.

51:09.196 --> 51:10.806
[Viper] We're not
trying to stop you.

51:10.937 --> 51:14.027
- What?
- We're coming with you!

51:38.617 --> 51:40.184
[Po yells]

51:51.586 --> 51:53.066
[yells]

51:53.893 --> 51:56.069
[yelling continues]

51:56.200 --> 51:58.985
[shouting]

52:23.749 --> 52:25.359
[burping]

52:27.100 --> 52:30.712
What? I eat when I'm upset, OK?

52:31.887 --> 52:33.150
Oh. No need to explain.

52:33.280 --> 52:35.108
I just thought
you might be Monkey.

52:35.239 --> 52:37.545
He hides his almond cookies
on the top shelf.

52:38.677 --> 52:40.026
[gasping]

52:42.115 --> 52:44.117
[dishes clattering]

52:58.262 --> 52:59.915
Don't tell Monkey.

53:00.046 --> 53:03.005
- Look at you.
- Yeah, I know, I disgust you.

53:03.136 --> 53:06.270
No, I mean,
how did you get up there?

53:06.400 --> 53:09.316
I don't know. I guess that...

53:09.447 --> 53:11.753
I don't know.
I was getting a cookie.

53:11.884 --> 53:14.495
And yet you are ten feet
off the ground.

53:14.626 --> 53:17.019
And you have done
a perfect spilt.

53:17.150 --> 53:20.806
No, this? This is just...

53:20.936 --> 53:21.981
...an accident.

53:22.111 --> 53:23.939
- [shouts]
- [crashing]

53:26.507 --> 53:29.510
There are no accidents.

53:29.641 --> 53:30.859
Come with me.

53:33.906 --> 53:36.822
[Po panting heavily]

53:38.737 --> 53:42.001
I know you're trying to be
all mystical and kung fuey...

53:42.131 --> 53:45.047
...but could you at least
tell me where we're going?

53:45.178 --> 53:48.964
[panting heavily]

53:54.883 --> 53:57.321
You dragged me...

53:57.451 --> 53:59.061
...all the way out here...

53:59.192 --> 54:00.628
...for a bath?

54:04.197 --> 54:09.115
Panda... we do not wash our pits
in the Pool of Sacred Tears.

54:09.246 --> 54:11.422
Huh?
The Pool of...

54:11.552 --> 54:14.076
This is where Oogway
unraveled the mysteries...

54:14.207 --> 54:16.209
...of harmony and focus.

54:16.340 --> 54:18.864
This is the birthplace...

54:18.994 --> 54:20.431
...of kung fu.

54:23.085 --> 54:24.435
[gasps]

54:34.271 --> 54:36.621
Do you want to learn kung fu?

54:36.751 --> 54:40.842
- Yeah!
- Then I am your master!

54:40.973 --> 54:43.889
OK! [sniffs]

54:44.019 --> 54:45.151
Don't cry.

54:45.282 --> 54:47.588
OK. [sniffing]

54:52.245 --> 54:54.291
When you focus
on kung fu,

54:54.421 --> 54:58.120
when you concentrate...
you stink.

54:58.251 --> 54:59.948
But, perhaps, that is my fault.

55:00.079 --> 55:03.604
I cannot train you the way
I have trained the Five.

55:03.735 --> 55:06.781
I now see that the way
to get through to you...

55:06.912 --> 55:08.130
...is with this.

55:08.261 --> 55:12.874
- Oh, great, 'cause I am hungry.
- Good.

55:13.005 --> 55:15.877
When you have been trained,
you may eat.

55:17.052 --> 55:18.445
Let us begin.

55:18.576 --> 55:20.969
[Po grunting]

55:24.146 --> 55:27.106
Whoa! Oh... [yells]

55:30.414 --> 55:33.330
[shouting]

55:35.462 --> 55:36.855
Yah! Yah!

55:53.480 --> 55:54.699
Ow!

56:10.802 --> 56:12.325
Yah!

56:14.458 --> 56:16.198
Yah!

56:28.950 --> 56:32.127
- [Shifu] After you, panda.
- Just like that?

56:32.258 --> 56:35.696
No sit-ups? No ten-mile hike?

56:35.827 --> 56:38.482
I vowed to train you,
and you have been trained.

56:38.612 --> 56:40.614
You are free to eat.

56:45.880 --> 56:47.621
Enjoy.

56:48.927 --> 56:50.494
- Hey!
- [munching]

56:50.624 --> 56:53.845
I said you are free to eat.
Have a dumpling.

56:54.976 --> 56:56.630
Hey!

57:02.767 --> 57:04.551
You are free to eat.

57:04.682 --> 57:06.858
- Am I?!
- Are you?!

57:08.250 --> 57:09.861
Whooaa...

57:23.962 --> 57:25.572
[laughing]

57:34.929 --> 57:36.061
Whoo!

57:38.672 --> 57:40.500
Ow! Ow!

57:53.034 --> 57:55.123
[both grunting]

58:03.044 --> 58:04.263
[panting]

58:07.092 --> 58:10.487
[both shouting]

58:15.100 --> 58:17.015
[chortles]

58:33.118 --> 58:34.772
I'm not hungry.

58:38.253 --> 58:39.559
Master.

59:01.450 --> 59:03.496
[panting]

59:06.630 --> 59:08.196
[growling]

59:09.546 --> 59:10.982
Cut it!

59:28.042 --> 59:29.870
Where's the
Dragon Warrior?

59:30.001 --> 59:32.917
- How do you know
you're not looking at her?
- [laughing]

59:33.047 --> 59:35.223
You think I'm a fool?

59:35.354 --> 59:38.705
I know you're not the
Dragon Warrior. None of you!

59:38.836 --> 59:42.230
I heard how he fell out
of the sky on a ball of fire.

59:42.361 --> 59:46.495
That he's a warrior
unlike anything
the world has ever seen.

59:46.626 --> 59:52.371
- Po?
- So that is his name. Po.

59:52.501 --> 59:55.592
Finally, a worthy opponent.

59:55.722 --> 59:59.465
- Our battle will be legendary!
- [snarling]

01:00:13.392 --> 01:00:15.394
- [grunts]
- [shouts]

01:00:18.223 --> 01:00:20.007
We've got this. Help her.

01:00:44.249 --> 01:00:47.339
- Monkey!
- Go!

01:00:47.469 --> 01:00:48.819
What was I thinking?!

01:00:52.910 --> 01:00:53.998
[shouts]

01:00:59.090 --> 01:01:00.308
Mantis!

01:01:05.270 --> 01:01:06.924
Now!

01:01:21.590 --> 01:01:25.159
- [screaming]
- Ah!

01:01:29.555 --> 01:01:31.165
[thumping]

01:01:51.795 --> 01:01:55.189
- [gasping]
- Shifu taught you well.

01:01:57.931 --> 01:02:00.064
But he didn't
teach you everything.

01:02:04.024 --> 01:02:05.417
[Shifu]
You have done well, panda.

01:02:05.547 --> 01:02:09.247
Done well? Done well?

01:02:09.377 --> 01:02:10.814
I've done awesome!

01:02:12.424 --> 01:02:15.383
The mark of a true hero
is humility.

01:02:15.514 --> 01:02:18.822
- But, yes, you have done...
- Ow!

01:02:18.952 --> 01:02:20.214
...awesome.

01:02:20.345 --> 01:02:21.607
[both laughing]

01:02:21.738 --> 01:02:26.394
- [footsteps approaching]
- Huh?

01:02:27.569 --> 01:02:30.877
Guys? Guys?!
They're dead!

01:02:31.008 --> 01:02:34.141
No, they're breathing. They're
asleep? No, their eyes are open.

01:02:34.272 --> 01:02:36.404
We were no match
for his nerve attach.

01:02:36.535 --> 01:02:38.711
He's gotten stronger.

01:02:38.842 --> 01:02:41.627
Who? Tai Lung? Stronger?

01:02:41.758 --> 01:02:45.109
He's too fast!
Sorry, Po.

01:02:46.980 --> 01:02:50.375
- I thought we could stop him.
- He could have killed you.

01:02:50.505 --> 01:02:52.116
[groaning]
Why didn't he?

01:02:52.246 --> 01:02:54.858
So you could come back and
strike fear into our hearts.

01:02:54.988 --> 01:03:00.341
- But it won't work.
- It might. I mean, a little.

01:03:00.472 --> 01:03:01.603
I'm pretty scared.

01:03:01.734 --> 01:03:03.301
You can defeat him, panda!

01:03:03.431 --> 01:03:06.086
Are you kidding?
If they can't?!

01:03:06.217 --> 01:03:09.437
They're five masters.
I'm just one me.

01:03:09.568 --> 01:03:13.006
But you will have the one thing
that no one else does.

01:03:18.098 --> 01:03:20.579
You really believe
I'm ready?

01:03:20.709 --> 01:03:22.363
You are...

01:03:22.494 --> 01:03:23.974
...Po.

01:04:12.674 --> 01:04:16.243
Behold the Dragon Scroll.

01:04:16.374 --> 01:04:18.071
It is yours.

01:04:18.202 --> 01:04:21.248
Wait. What happens
when I read it?

01:04:21.379 --> 01:04:25.426
No one knows. But legend says
you will be able to hear
a butterfly's wing beat.

01:04:25.557 --> 01:04:27.689
Whoa. Really? That's cool.

01:04:27.820 --> 01:04:30.649
Yes. And see light
in the deepest cave.

01:04:30.779 --> 01:04:33.521
You will feel the universe
in motion around you.

01:04:33.652 --> 01:04:35.523
Wow! Can I
punch through walls?

01:04:35.654 --> 01:04:37.874
- Do a quadruple back flip?
- Focus.

01:04:38.004 --> 01:04:39.440
- Will I have...?
- Focus.

01:04:39.571 --> 01:04:41.138
- Focus.
- Oh, yeah, yeah.

01:04:41.268 --> 01:04:42.313
Read it, Po,

01:04:42.443 --> 01:04:44.054
and fulfill your destiny.

01:04:44.184 --> 01:04:46.404
Read it and become...

01:04:46.534 --> 01:04:48.188
...the Dragon Warrior.

01:04:48.319 --> 01:04:49.886
Whoa!

01:04:52.889 --> 01:04:55.065
[straining]

01:04:55.195 --> 01:04:56.370
It's impossible to open.

01:04:56.501 --> 01:05:01.288
OK. Come on, baby.
Come on now.

01:05:01.419 --> 01:05:04.422
- [top pops]
- Thank you.

01:05:04.552 --> 01:05:06.990
I probably loosened it up
for you though.

01:05:07.120 --> 01:05:10.080
[clears throat]
OK, here goes.

01:05:14.954 --> 01:05:19.045
- [screaming]
- [all gasp]

01:05:21.874 --> 01:05:23.528
- It's blank.
- What?!

01:05:23.658 --> 01:05:24.833
Here, look.

01:05:24.964 --> 01:05:27.097
No, I am forbidden
to look upon...

01:05:33.059 --> 01:05:35.888
Blank. I don't...

01:05:36.019 --> 01:05:38.282
I don't understand.

01:05:39.500 --> 01:05:41.938
OK. So, like...

01:05:42.068 --> 01:05:45.419
...Oogway was just
a crazy old turtle after all.

01:05:45.550 --> 01:05:48.118
No. Oogway was wiser
than us all.

01:05:48.248 --> 01:05:52.339
Oh, come on! Face it,
he picked me by accident.

01:05:52.470 --> 01:05:56.474
Of course I'm not the Dragon
Warrior. Who am I kidding?

01:05:56.604 --> 01:05:59.172
[Tigress]
But who will stop Tai Lung?

01:05:59.303 --> 01:06:01.653
[Crane] He'll destroy
everything and everyone.

01:06:01.783 --> 01:06:03.742
No.

01:06:03.872 --> 01:06:05.613
Evacuate the valley.

01:06:05.744 --> 01:06:09.139
You must protect the villagers
from Tai Lung's rage.

01:06:09.269 --> 01:06:11.793
- What about you, Master?
- I will fight him.

01:06:11.924 --> 01:06:14.535
- What?
- I can hold him off long enough

01:06:14.666 --> 01:06:18.539
- for everyone to escape.
- But, Shifu, he'll kill you.

01:06:18.670 --> 01:06:21.412
Then I will finally have paid
for my mistake.

01:06:21.542 --> 01:06:24.632
Listen to me, all of you.

01:06:24.763 --> 01:06:27.940
It is time for you to continue
your journey without me.

01:06:28.071 --> 01:06:31.422
I am very proud
to have been your master.

01:06:52.051 --> 01:06:54.227
We've got to
get them out safely.

01:06:54.358 --> 01:06:56.751
Come, little one.
Let's find your mama.

01:06:56.882 --> 01:07:00.407
Viper, gather the southern
farmers. Mantis, the north.

01:07:00.538 --> 01:07:02.366
Crane, light the way.

01:07:21.298 --> 01:07:24.475
Look, it's the
Dragon Warrior.

01:07:29.262 --> 01:07:31.090
[exhaling deeply]

01:07:33.092 --> 01:07:34.876
Hey, Dad.

01:07:35.007 --> 01:07:36.487
Po!

01:07:42.275 --> 01:07:44.495
Good to have you back, son.

01:07:46.845 --> 01:07:48.194
Good to be back.

01:07:48.325 --> 01:07:50.153
Let's go, Po.

01:07:52.503 --> 01:07:55.332
So for our next shop,
it's time to face it...

01:07:55.462 --> 01:07:59.249
...the future of noodles
is dice-cut vegetables...

01:07:59.379 --> 01:08:01.338
...no longer slices.

01:08:01.468 --> 01:08:04.819
Also, I was thinking,
maybe this time

01:08:04.950 --> 01:08:08.432
we'll have a kitchen
you can actually stand up in.

01:08:09.650 --> 01:08:10.956
You like that?

01:08:16.875 --> 01:08:21.488
Po, I'm sorry
if things didn't work out.

01:08:21.619 --> 01:08:24.796
It just
wasn't meant to be.

01:08:28.104 --> 01:08:30.497
Po, forget everything else.

01:08:30.628 --> 01:08:32.760
Your destiny still awaits.

01:08:32.891 --> 01:08:37.722
We are noodle folk. Broth runs
deep through our veins.

01:08:37.852 --> 01:08:40.116
I don't know, Dad.

01:08:40.246 --> 01:08:44.294
Honestly, sometimes I can't
believe I'm actually your son.

01:08:45.860 --> 01:08:48.472
[chuckles] Po...

01:08:48.602 --> 01:08:52.998
...I think it's time
I told you something
I should have told you...

01:08:53.129 --> 01:08:57.089
- ...a long time ago.
- OK.

01:08:58.656 --> 01:09:02.573
The secret ingredient
of my Secret Ingredient Soup.

01:09:02.703 --> 01:09:05.097
Oh.

01:09:05.228 --> 01:09:09.841
Come here.
The secret ingredient is...

01:09:09.971 --> 01:09:12.409
- ...nothing.
- Huh?

01:09:12.539 --> 01:09:17.327
You heard me. Nothing!
There is no secret ingredient!

01:09:17.457 --> 01:09:20.547
Wait, wait.
It's just plain old noodle soup?

01:09:20.678 --> 01:09:22.854
You don't add some kind of
special sauce or something?

01:09:22.984 --> 01:09:28.164
Don't have to.
To make something special,
you just believe it's special.

01:09:38.739 --> 01:09:41.351
There is no secret ingredient.

01:09:47.357 --> 01:09:49.359
[thunderclap]

01:09:50.186 --> 01:09:51.883
[thunder rumbling]

01:09:58.368 --> 01:10:00.196
[thunderclap]

01:10:03.721 --> 01:10:06.637
I have come home, Master.

01:10:06.767 --> 01:10:09.901
This is no longer your home.
And I am no longer your master.

01:10:10.031 --> 01:10:13.861
Oh, yes.
You have a new favorite.

01:10:13.992 --> 01:10:16.821
So where is this Po?

01:10:16.951 --> 01:10:19.606
[chuckles]
Did I scare him off?

01:10:19.737 --> 01:10:22.000
This battle is
between you and me.

01:10:22.130 --> 01:10:27.005
So, that is how
it's going to be.

01:10:27.135 --> 01:10:29.050
That is how it must be.

01:10:29.181 --> 01:10:32.010
[growling]

01:10:32.140 --> 01:10:34.099
[shouting]

01:10:43.630 --> 01:10:47.808
I rotted in jail for 20 years
because of your weakness!

01:10:47.939 --> 01:10:50.158
Obeying your master
is not weakness!

01:10:50.289 --> 01:10:52.944
You knew I was
the Dragon Warrior.

01:10:53.074 --> 01:10:55.294
You always knew.

01:10:55.425 --> 01:11:00.517
But when Oogway said otherwise,
what did you do?

01:11:01.909 --> 01:11:04.216
What did you do?!

01:11:06.262 --> 01:11:09.352
- Nothing!
- You were not meant
to be the Dragon Warrior!

01:11:09.482 --> 01:11:10.614
That was not my fault!

01:11:10.744 --> 01:11:12.659
Not your fault?!

01:11:12.790 --> 01:11:14.792
Who filled my head with dreams?!

01:11:14.922 --> 01:11:17.011
Who drove me to train
until my bones cracked?!

01:11:17.142 --> 01:11:20.058
Who denied me my destiny?!

01:11:28.936 --> 01:11:31.939
- It was never
my decision to make!
- [snarls]

01:11:37.118 --> 01:11:38.642
It is now.

01:11:43.603 --> 01:11:47.259
Give me the scroll!

01:11:47.390 --> 01:11:48.956
I would rather die.

01:11:52.090 --> 01:11:54.310
[straining, grunts]

01:12:23.817 --> 01:12:27.343
[both shouting]

01:12:36.700 --> 01:12:38.745
[snarling]

01:12:38.876 --> 01:12:41.748
All I ever did,
I did to make you proud!

01:12:41.879 --> 01:12:44.708
Tell me
how proud you are, Shifu!

01:12:45.622 --> 01:12:47.450
- Tell me!
- [grunting]

01:12:47.580 --> 01:12:49.452
Tell me!

01:12:59.636 --> 01:13:03.509
I have...
I have always been proud of you.

01:13:03.640 --> 01:13:07.426
From the first moment,
I've been...

01:13:07.557 --> 01:13:09.863
...proud of you.

01:13:09.994 --> 01:13:12.170
And it was my pride...

01:13:12.300 --> 01:13:14.215
...that blinded me.

01:13:14.346 --> 01:13:18.176
I loved you too much to see
what you were becoming...

01:13:19.003 --> 01:13:21.266
...what I...

01:13:21.397 --> 01:13:23.486
...was turning you into.

01:13:24.138 --> 01:13:25.966
I'm...

01:13:26.097 --> 01:13:27.359
I'm sorry.

01:13:34.322 --> 01:13:38.283
[snarling]
I don't want your apology.

01:13:38.414 --> 01:13:40.198
I want my scroll!

01:13:41.939 --> 01:13:45.725
What?!
Where is it?!

01:13:45.856 --> 01:13:48.511
Dragon Warrior
has taken the scroll

01:13:48.641 --> 01:13:52.428
halfway across China by now.

01:13:52.558 --> 01:13:55.387
You will never see
that scroll, Tai Lung.

01:13:55.518 --> 01:13:58.912
Never.
[straining] Never.

01:13:59.043 --> 01:14:00.784
[Po] Hey!

01:14:01.959 --> 01:14:05.049
[breathing heavily]

01:14:05.963 --> 01:14:07.399
Stairs.

01:14:09.662 --> 01:14:11.447
Who are you?

01:14:11.577 --> 01:14:16.364
Buddy, I am the Dragon Warrior.

01:14:16.495 --> 01:14:18.062
[panting]

01:14:19.585 --> 01:14:21.674
You? [chuckles]

01:14:21.805 --> 01:14:23.807
Him? He's a panda.

01:14:23.937 --> 01:14:27.767
You're a panda. What are you
gonna do, big guy? Sit on me?

01:14:27.898 --> 01:14:30.466
Don't tempt me. No.

01:14:30.596 --> 01:14:33.860
I'm gonna use this.

01:14:33.991 --> 01:14:35.601
You want it? Come and get it.

01:14:35.732 --> 01:14:38.778
- Oh!
- Finally!

01:14:41.302 --> 01:14:42.913
[chuckles]

01:14:43.043 --> 01:14:45.437
Yaaa! Whooo!

01:14:45.568 --> 01:14:51.225
- [growling]
- Ooh... [screams]

01:14:53.227 --> 01:14:55.186
- [snarls]
- [chuckles]

01:15:04.543 --> 01:15:06.197
That scroll is mine!

01:15:08.416 --> 01:15:12.203
[both shouting]

01:15:26.391 --> 01:15:27.566
Oh!

01:15:35.618 --> 01:15:37.750
[screaming]

01:15:40.884 --> 01:15:42.233
[crashing]

01:15:44.322 --> 01:15:45.802
Whoa!

01:15:59.729 --> 01:16:00.991
Lightning!

01:16:03.297 --> 01:16:05.735
Aah! [chortling]

01:16:15.092 --> 01:16:18.269
[shouting]

01:16:28.409 --> 01:16:29.541
[gasps]

01:16:36.113 --> 01:16:38.506
[Tai Lung]
The scroll has given him power!

01:16:38.637 --> 01:16:40.421
No!

01:16:44.034 --> 01:16:46.079
- Oh!
- [growls]

01:17:12.279 --> 01:17:15.674
[panting]

01:17:16.632 --> 01:17:20.548
Finally! Oh, yes.

01:17:20.679 --> 01:17:25.728
The power of the
Dragon Scroll is mine!

01:17:29.819 --> 01:17:32.082
It's nothing!

01:17:33.953 --> 01:17:36.652
It's OK. I didn't get it
the first time, either.

01:17:37.217 --> 01:17:38.479
What?

01:17:39.567 --> 01:17:41.526
There is no secret ingredient.

01:17:44.834 --> 01:17:46.270
It's just you.

01:17:50.230 --> 01:17:52.319
- [roaring]
- [screams]

01:17:53.407 --> 01:17:55.366
[laughing]

01:17:55.888 --> 01:17:57.020
Stop it!

01:17:57.150 --> 01:17:58.717
I'm gonna pee.

01:17:58.848 --> 01:18:01.981
[laughing] Don't.

01:18:02.112 --> 01:18:05.593
- Don't! Don't!
- Yahhh!

01:18:33.447 --> 01:18:34.448
[meowing]

01:18:34.579 --> 01:18:35.798
[roaring]

01:18:42.195 --> 01:18:43.936
Oh!

01:18:44.067 --> 01:18:48.419
[roaring]

01:19:02.389 --> 01:19:05.610
[screaming]

01:19:10.920 --> 01:19:12.748
You...

01:19:12.878 --> 01:19:15.185
...can't defeat me.

01:19:19.537 --> 01:19:20.930
You...

01:19:22.235 --> 01:19:23.759
...you're just a big...

01:19:23.889 --> 01:19:25.412
...fat...

01:19:25.543 --> 01:19:26.762
...panda!

01:19:27.675 --> 01:19:30.678
I'm not a big fat panda.

01:19:30.809 --> 01:19:33.203
I'm the big fat panda.

01:19:35.335 --> 01:19:36.815
The Wuxi Finger Hold!

01:19:36.946 --> 01:19:38.295
Oh, you know this hold?

01:19:38.425 --> 01:19:40.340
You're bluffing.
You're bluffing.

01:19:40.471 --> 01:19:42.342
Shifu didn't teach you that.

01:19:42.473 --> 01:19:44.127
Nope.

01:19:44.257 --> 01:19:46.564
I figured it out. Skadoosh.

01:19:51.264 --> 01:19:54.833
- [all gasping]
- [wind howling]

01:19:59.751 --> 01:20:02.232
[chattering indistinctly]

01:20:06.889 --> 01:20:08.238
Look!

01:20:09.282 --> 01:20:11.458
The Dragon Warrior.

01:20:21.294 --> 01:20:22.992
[coughing]

01:20:25.255 --> 01:20:27.474
[all cheering]

01:20:38.746 --> 01:20:43.795
That's my boy! That big lovely
kung fu warrior is my son!

01:20:45.753 --> 01:20:46.929
Yes!

01:20:48.060 --> 01:20:49.801
Thanks, Dad.

01:20:58.810 --> 01:21:00.464
Hey, guys.

01:21:05.034 --> 01:21:06.339
Master.

01:21:06.470 --> 01:21:08.037
[all] Master.

01:21:10.822 --> 01:21:12.476
Master?

01:21:12.606 --> 01:21:14.217
Master Shifu!

01:21:18.874 --> 01:21:21.267
[panting]

01:21:27.099 --> 01:21:28.492
Master!

01:21:28.622 --> 01:21:31.060
Shifu, are you OK?!

01:21:32.061 --> 01:21:34.367
[grunts] Po.

01:21:34.498 --> 01:21:36.326
You're alive.

01:21:36.456 --> 01:21:39.546
- Or we're both dead.
- No, Master, I didn't die.

01:21:39.677 --> 01:21:43.072
- I defeated Tai Lung.
- You did?

01:21:47.250 --> 01:21:52.951
Wow. It is as Oogway foretold.

01:21:53.082 --> 01:21:56.607
You are the Dragon Warrior.

01:21:56.737 --> 01:21:59.610
You have brought peace...

01:21:59.740 --> 01:22:02.395
...to this valley...

01:22:02.526 --> 01:22:04.789
...and...

01:22:04.920 --> 01:22:06.399
...and to me.

01:22:06.530 --> 01:22:09.576
Thank you.

01:22:09.707 --> 01:22:12.884
Thank you, Po.

01:22:13.015 --> 01:22:15.800
Thank you. Thank you.

01:22:20.979 --> 01:22:26.115
No! Master! No, no, no,
don't die, Shifu, please!

01:22:26.245 --> 01:22:28.769
I'm not dying, you idiot!

01:22:28.900 --> 01:22:31.120
Dragon Warrior...

01:22:32.251 --> 01:22:37.213
...I am simply at peace.
Finally.

01:22:38.692 --> 01:22:42.914
Oh! So, I should stop talking?

01:22:43.567 --> 01:22:45.221
If you can.

01:23:02.978 --> 01:23:04.675
Want to get
something to eat?

01:23:04.805 --> 01:23:06.633
[sighing deeply]

01:23:07.460 --> 01:23:08.679
Yeah.

01:23:12.204 --> 01:23:14.163
[♪ Cee-Lo Green and Jack Black:
